  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/665/665-7.htm",
  "statuteText": "665:7 Filing Disputes. –\n\nThe ballot law commission shall hear and determine disputes arising over whether nomination papers or declarations of candidacy filed with the secretary of state conform with the law. The decision of the ballot law commission in such cases shall be final as to questions both of law and fact, and no court shall have jurisdiction to review such decision."
}
